"false\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" class=\"menu-toggle mobile-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><main id=\"main\"><section aria-labelledby=\"guide-hero-title\" class=\"hero premium-container\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-glow\"></div>\n<div class=\"hero-copy\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\"><span>✦</span> WISHLY · DIGITAL EXPERIENCES FOR REAL FEELINGS</div>\n<h1 id=\"guide-hero-title\">Make their moment feel <em>unforgettable.</em></h1>\n<p>Explore thoughtful inspiration and step-by-step tutorials for birthday websites, romantic proposals, anniversary pages, wedding invitations and digital letters. Learn how to shape a personal experience with Wishly, make it your own and share one link with someone, anywhere in the world.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-actions\">\n<a class=\"premium-button hero-cta\" href=\"/guides/\">Explore the guides <span>→</span></a>\n<a class=\"premium-button premium-button-ghost\" href=\"https://wishly.bd/create/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Create with Wishly <span>↗</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-proof\"><span><b>✓</b> Practical step-by-step ideas</span><span><b>✓</b> English and Bengali guides</span><span><b>✓</b> One link to share</span></div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-art\">\n<div class=\"hero-orbit orbit-a\"><i class=\"orbit-dot\"></i></div><div class=\"hero-orbit orbit-b\"><i class=\"orbit-dot d2\"></i></div>\n<div class=\"hero-card hero-card-back\"><small>FOR SOMEONE SPECIAL</small><strong>Make the little details matter.</strong><span>Words · Photos · Memories</span></div>\n<div class=\"hero-card hero-card-main\">\n<div class=\"hero-card-top\"><span>✦ WISHLY</span><span>GUIDE · HOW IT WORKS</span></div>\n<div class=\"hd\">\n<div class=\"hd-stage\">\n<div class=\"hd-scene hd-s1\"><p class=\"hd-cap\">Choose a template</p><div class=\"hd-tiles\"><span class=\"hd-tile t1\"><b>🎂</b><b>Birthday</b></span><span clas