\"occasion-arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"occasion-card tint-gold reveal\" href=\"/guides/\"><span class=\"occasion-icon\">💍</span><h3>Wedding &amp; invitations</h3><p>Share event details through an online invitation experience.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"occasion-arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"occasion-card tint-mint reveal\" href=\"/guides/\"><span class=\"occasion-icon\">🤍</span><h3>Anniversary memories</h3><p>Celebrate your journey with a page made around shared moments.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"occasion-arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"occasion-card tint-blue reveal\" href=\"/guides/\"><span class=\"occasion-icon\">🫶</span><h3>Friendship &amp; thank-you</h3><p>Say what matters with a personal message for someone important.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"occasion-arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"occasion-card tint-peach reveal\" href=\"/guides/\"><span class=\"occasion-icon\">🌙</span><h3>Sorry &amp; miss-you pages</h3><p>Create a gentle space for an apology or a message across distance.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"occasion-arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"occasion-card tint-lilac reveal\" href=\"/guides/\"><span class=\"occasion-icon\">✉️</span><h3>Digital letters</h3><p>Present your words as an experience rather than another plain text.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"occasion-arrow\">↗</span></a><a class=\"occasion-card tint-gold reveal\" href=\"/guides/\"><span class=\"occasion-icon\">✨</span><h3>Just because</h3><p>A surprise does not need a calendar date or a special occasion.</p><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"occasion-arrow\">↗</span></a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section section-white\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head center reveal\"><p class=\"kicker\">HOW WISHLY WORKS</p><h2>From a little idea to<br/><em>a link worth opening.</em></h2><p>Wishly is a browser-based website maker. Start with a template, make it yours and share the finished experience.</p></div><div class=\"steps-