</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"how to create a digital memory book website turn photos, captions and shared stories into a digital memory book website with a clear timeline, meaningful chapters and thoughtful sharing.\" href=\"/guides/digital-memory-book-website/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"A digital anniversary memory book website built around photographs and a personal story\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/digital-memory-book-website.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Digital memory book ideas</span><h3>How to Create a Digital Memory Book Website</h3><p>Turn photos, captions and shared stories into a digital memory book website with a clear timeline, meaningful chapters and thoughtful sharing.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>New guide</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"how to share a surprise website privately and thoughtfully learn how to share a personal surprise website responsibly, protect sensitive information, check links and respect the privacy of people in your photos.\" href=\"/guides/share-surprise-website-privately/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"A guide to checking a personal surprise website link before sharing it\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/private-surprise-website-sharing.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Website sharing &amp; privacy</span><h3>How to Share a Surprise Website Privately and Thoughtfully</h3><p>Learn how to share a personal surprise website responsibly, protect sensitive information, check links and respect the privacy of people in your photos.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>New guide</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" data-guide-card=\"\" data-search=\"meet ra fahim: the developer and creator behind wishly meet ra fahim, the web developer and creator behind wishly, and learn about the idea of making personal websites easier to create and share.\" href=\"/guides/ra-fahim-developer-behind-wishly/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"RA Fahim, web developer and creator of Wishly\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/ra-fahim-developer-wishly.webp\" width=\"540\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Founder story · Developer profile</span><h3>Meet RA Fahim: The Developer and Creator Behind Wishly</h3><p>Meet RA Fahim, the web developer and creator behind Wishly, and learn about the idea of making personal websites easier to create and share.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>New guide</span><span>Read guide ↗</span></div></div></a></div></div></section><section class=\"ad-band\"><div class=\"container\"><aside aria-label=\"Advertisements\" class=\"ad-slot\" data-ad-key=\"home-inline\"><span class=\"ad-label\">Advertisements</span><div class=\"ad-render\"></div></aside></div></section>\n<section class=\"ad-band\"><div class=\"container\"></div></section><section class=\"section section-dark\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head center reveal\"><p class=\"kicker\">THOUGHTFUL TOOLS</p><h2>Every detail helps make<br/><em>the moment yours.</em></h2><p>Wishly combines ready-made designs with a visual workflow. Available tools and interactions can vary by template.</p></div><div class=\"feature-grid\"><article class=\"feature-card reveal\"><span class=\"feature-icon\">✍️</span><h3>Visual editing</h3><p>Edit supported text and media in the context of the template.</p></article><article class=\"feature-card reveal\"><span class=\"feature-icon\">🖼️</span><h3>Photos &amp; galleries</h3><p>Add personal pictures and arrange galleries where the design supports them.</p></article><article class=\"feature-card reveal\"><span class=\"feature-icon\">🎵</span><h3>Audio &amp; video</h3><p>Bring a story to life with supported music, audio or video elements.</p></article><article class=\"feature-card reveal\"><span class=\"feature-icon\">🎨</span><h3>Theme &amp; font settings</h3><p>Choose a color style and font for the template you are editing.</p></article><article class=\"feature-card reveal\"><span class=\"feature-icon\">📱</span><h3>Phone-friendly workflow</h3><p>Create and review your experience from a phone or computer.</p></article><article class=\"feature-card reveal\"><span class=\"feature-icon\">🔗</span><h3>Easy sharing</h3><p>Publish a page link and share it through chat or a QR code.</p></article></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container split-panel\"><div class=\"split-art reveal\"><div class=\"mini-editor\"><div class=\"mini-editor-bar\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"mini-editor-main\"><div class=\"mini-canvas\"><b>Made<br/>for you ♡</b></div><div class=\"mini-controls\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"editor-float\">✦ Your style, your story</div></div><div class=\"split-copy reveal delay-1\"><p class=\"kicker\">YOUR DESIGN, YOUR WAY</p><h2>Personal details.<br/><em>Beautifully presented.</em></h2><p>A template gives you a thoughtful starting point. The visual editor helps you replace sample details with your own story, so the final page feels personal rather than generic.</p><ul class=\"check-list\"><li>Update supported text, names, dates and images.</li><li>Choose a theme color and font from design settings.</li><li>Preview the visitor experience before publishing.</li><li>Keep the published link ready to share with one person or a group.</li></ul><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/guides/create-wish-website/\">See how to get started ↗</a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section section-white\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"cta-band reveal\"><div><h2>Make someone feel remembered.</h2><p>Explore the guides, find an id