uide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Communication &amp; Repair</span><h3>How to Apologize to Your Girlfriend</h3><p>A practical guide to taking responsibility and making a sincere apology.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>Read guide</span><span>Explore ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" href=\"/guides/long-distance-relationship-ideas/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Long-Distance Relationship Ideas — Wishly Guide\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/miss-you-template.webp\" width=\"960\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Long-Distance</span><h3>Long-Distance Relationship Ideas</h3><p>Stay connected with shared rituals, personal messages and virtual experiences.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>Read guide</span><span>Explore ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" href=\"/guides/girlfriend-birthday-surprise-ideas/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Girlfriend Birthday Surprise Ideas — Wishly Guide\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/birthday-magic-template.webp\" width=\"960\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Special Occasions</span><h3>Girlfriend Birthday Surprise Ideas</h3><p>Plan a birthday celebration around her interests, memories and favourite details.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>Read guide</span><span>Explore ↗</span></div></div></a><a class=\"guide-card reveal\" href=\"/guides/how-to-create-a-romantic-surprise-website/\"><div class=\"guide-art\"><img alt=\"Create a Romantic Surprise Website — Wishly Guide\" height=\"630\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/editorial/romantic-online-proposal.webp\" width=\"1200\"/></div><div class=\"guide-info\"><span class=\"guide-tag\">Wishly Tutorials</span><h3>Create a Romantic Surprise Website</h3><p>Build a personalised online surprise with photos, a letter and one shareable link.</p><div class=\"guide-meta\"><span>Read guide</span><span>Explore ↗</span></div></div></a></div><